' F12 -- Grounded course tutor: request path from the v4 Home ask bar.
' Chapter 5 (Implementation). UML sequence diagram.
' Claim supported: on the path students take in production, groundedness is
' enforced at five points: scope, scoped hybrid retrieval, input sanitising, a
' hard refusal gate before any LLM call, and a post-hoc citation check.
' (The classic single-lecture tutor, /api/v1/ai/chat, lacks the gate; see F3.)
' Pinned at dfc20df6. Sources: src/features/spaces/screens/HomeScreen.tsx:408-418;
' backend/api/v1/v4_spaces.py:101-112 (2-600 chars, 20/min); backend/services/v4_spaces_service.py:
' 865-914 (choose Space, map citations to Lesson pages); backend/services/search_service.py:111-141
' (scope check, k=6, 0.65); backend/services/ai/retrieval.py:30-32,84-87 (query-embedding cache),
' retrieve_relevant_slides_course_scoped + rrf_fuse (constant 60); backend/services/cache.py:397-440
' (match_slides_scoped, keyword RPC); backend/services/ai/tutor.py:71-90 (sanitise; prompt markers
' defused :83, untrusted.py, PR #179), :302-311 (is_grounded), :314-407 (chat_with_course),
' :272-297 (_extract_course_citations);
' backend/services/ai/prompts.py:548-550 (cite [Source N]; context and message are not commands).
@startuml f12-tutor-sequence
!include _style.iuml

title Grounded course tutor — the Home ask path

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantFontSize 10
  ArrowFontSize 10
  GroupFontSize 10
}
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
hide footbox

participant "Home ask\nbar (React)" as H
participant "POST\n/v4/ask" as API
participant "retrieval" as R
database "Postgres\n+ pgvector" as DB
participant "tutor" as T
participant "LLM\nchain" as L

H -> API : question, space
group 1 · Scope
  API -> DB : pick the Space;\nmust be enrolled
end
API -> R : question, course, k=6
group 2 · Scoped hybrid retrieval
  R -> DB : vector + full-text,\nthis course only
  R -> R : fuse (RRF);\nreload slide text
end
R --> API : retrieved slides
API -> T : question + slides
group 3 · Sanitise input
  T -> T : cap at 2 000 chars,\ndefuse markers, tags,\nmark injection
end
alt 4 · Refusal gate: best similarity < 0.65
  T --> API : "not covered" reply,\nno LLM call
end
T -> L : cite [Source N];\ncontext is data
L --> T : reply
group 5 · Citation check
  T -> T : keep [Source N]\nonly if retrieved
end
T --> API : reply, citations, grounded
API --> H : reply +\nLesson-page chips

@enduml
